      $k$, <code>balance-compose</code> proves transitivity across multi-hop tile rings, and
      <code>beat-drift : times q (suc p) ≡ plus q (times p q)</code> proves that detuning $p \mapsto p+1$ produces
      exact phase slip $q$ over one nominal cycle.
    </p>
  </div>

